1
00:00:00,062 --> 00:00:01,602
(Sheldon:)-Sarcasm?
-Yes.

2
00:00:01,772 --> 00:00:04,522
(Howard:)But mixed with genuine concern.

3
00:00:04,733 --> 00:00:06,113
(Sheldon:)For your information...

4
00:00:06,276 --> 00:00:09,156
(Sheldon:)...I'll be playing host
to Dr. Elizabeth Plimpton.

5
00:00:09,863 --> 00:00:12,993
(Raj:)-Cosmological physicist from Princeton?
-Yes.

6
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,080
(Sheldon:)And until you acquire
a surgical mask...

7
00:00:15,243 --> 00:00:18,333
(Sheldon:)...please address your comments to me
through a napkin.

8
00:00:18,497 --> 00:00:21,877
(Sheldon:)We've been corresponding for years
about our mutual interest...

9
00:00:22,084 --> 00:00:25,504
(Sheldon:)...in gravitational wave signatures
of inflatons in the early universe.

10
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:29,010
(Sheldon:)Now she's under consideration
for a position at our university.

11
00:00:29,216 --> 00:00:31,676
(Leonard:)Why didn't you tell me
you knew Elizabeth Plimpton?

12
00:00:31,843 --> 00:00:33,883
(Leonard:)I am a huge fan of hers.

13
00:00:34,054 --> 00:00:36,344
I didn't realize I had to share
my connection...

14
00:00:36,515 --> 00:00:38,765
(Sheldon:)...with things you're a fan of,
but, very well.

15
00:00:38,934 --> 00:00:41,724
(Sheldon:)You enjoy Canadian bacon.
I've been to Toronto.

16
00:00:42,604 --> 00:00:45,814
-Okay, fine. Where is she gonna sleep?
-My room, of course.

17
00:00:45,982 --> 00:00:47,362
(Raj:)Holy crap.

18
00:00:50,278 --> 00:00:52,318
(Raj:)Holy crap.

19
00:00:53,073 --> 00:00:55,993
-Yeah, I have a two-part question.
-Go ahead.

20
00:00:56,201 --> 00:00:57,371
(Howard:)A, are you kidding me?

21
00:00:57,536 --> 00:01:01,026
(Howard:)And B, seriously,
are you freaking kidding me?

